sentences.t:
Sifiom er þá blandat,
hverr er segia ræðr
einom allan hug;
allt er betra,
en sé brigðom at vera;
era sá vinr ǫðrom, er vilt eitt segir.

sentences.l:
With kinship it is then mingled,
whoever undertakes to tell
to one man his whole mind;
anything is better
than it be to be at breaches of faith;
he is no friend to another, who says false things only.
